      "user_created_at": null,
      "dated_source_position": null,
      "numeric_scheme": null,
      "numeric_id": null,
      "original_position": 3,
      "content": "找到了相关线索！有一个之前的对话和一个「合生纪」共享文件夹，我看看里面有什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": "conv_96e941b921d4:51e1e234",
      "role": "assistant",
      "status": "done",
      "source_line": 43573,
      "source_file": "messages",
